+ *           init_handler
+ *
+ * Crossover-IOS fork, patch 0006: iOS clears x18 on entry to a signal handler
+ * (as on every kernel->user transition). Wine reads the TEB from x18, so
+ * re-establish it from the durable pthread-backed NtCurrentTeb() before any
